Third-party terms
=================

The MIT license in LICENSE applies to the source code in this repository. It
does not cover the following, which are bundled or referenced under their own
terms.

Bundled model weights (assets/models/)
--------------------------------------

  - YOLOX detectors (hoopai-yolox*.tflite): Apache-2.0. These are the default
    engine.
  - MoveNet SinglePose Lightning (movenet-pose.tflite): Apache-2.0. Used only
    when form analysis is enabled.
  - YOLO11 detectors (hoopai-det*.tflite): AGPL-3.0. A user-selectable
    fallback, not the default, and NOT covered by the MIT grant above. It is
    flagged in src/core/legalCredits.ts for removal from any closed-source or
    paid build.

Training data
-------------

  - Roboflow Universe datasets, CC BY 4.0. Listed in src/core/legalCredits.ts
